## How split-tokens work
## OLD
$ cat hidad.txt
# linebr
# split-tokens hidad.txt
Hi Dad!

$ split-tokens hidad.txt
Hi
Dad!

# tokenize SPLITS THE CONTENTS IN SEVERAL LINES ()
## OLD
# tokenize _old_make.log
$ tokenize hidad.txt
Hi
Dad!

